{"id":7012,"chapter_id":7,"scene_id":702,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你们暂时消灭了基站附近的敌人，可紧张的气氛并没有缓解。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"为什么把局长带到这里？他才经历过黑环，又被关了那么久，身体从未得到恢复。为什么还要带他来这么危险的地方？","female_content":"为什么把局长带到这里？她才经历过黑环，又被关了那么久，身体从未得到恢复。为什么还要带她来这么危险的地方？","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022002","vo_cgplot_7022002f"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"局长回去后，难道不会被——","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"兰利","content":"不用担心，第九机关办事不需要他们准许。只有特务找别人的麻烦，从来不会反过来。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022004"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"赫卡蒂仍在警惕兰利，她拦在你身前，流露少见的强烈敌意。兰利笑着看看你。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"content":"你把手搭上赫卡蒂肩头。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"speaker":"选项","options":["我没事，不用担心"],"jump":[8],"style":6,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"赫卡蒂","content":"……真的吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022007"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"你比了个ok的手势，然后笑着摸摸她的头。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"选项","options":["看到你们也没事，我才放心了"],"jump":[11],"style":6,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"content":"你的视线也落在海拉身上，很久没见，她还好，只是有点沉默。在你看向她时快速别过脸移开目光，像有什么心事。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"speaker":"兰利","content":"你有一群很可爱的部下，很忠诚。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022011"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"兰利","content":"……别推开她们。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022012"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"选项","options":["我怎么可能这么做？","我不明白你的意思"],"jump":[15,17],"style":6,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"speaker":"兰利","content":"提个醒罢了。我挺喜欢你的，作为过来人，给你点建议。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022014"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"兰利","content":"我的意思是……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022016"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"兰利","content":"别抱着你那点小秘密，把自己关进禁闭室不出来。","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022017"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":19,"speaker":"兰利","content":"你一个人背负不了全部，尤其面对这种东西……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022018"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":20,"content":"说罢，赤色光环像感应到你们的对话般，扭动了起来。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":21,"content":"一阵轻盈的笑声传来。从黑环中，走出了一个黑色的倩影。","style":3,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":22,"speaker":"？？","content":"我感受到了……特别的观众……不一样的观众……","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022021"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1},{"step":23,"speaker":"？？","content":"你……是来看我跳舞的吗？","voice":["vo_cgplot_7022022"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_07","style":1,"background":703,"log_type":1}]}